cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "Comparison for the Parabolic Bernoulli Problem"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Feldman
    given-names: William M.
repository-code: "https://github.com/willmfeldman/bernoulli-parabolic-comparison"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the comparison principle between supersolutions and
  relaxed subsolutions of the parabolic Bernoulli (one-phase free boundary)
  problem, for viscosity solutions defined by comparison with classical strict
  barriers, following the approach of I. C. Kim (2003).
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - free boundary problems
  - viscosity solutions
